R0069 runtime monitor.unconsumed          `{name}` was dropped holding a value of `{ty}`, which must be passed to an `own` parameter
R0070 runtime defer.declarations-only     only rules about declarations reject the program, and the run reached no conflict: a candidate false positive
R0071 runtime monitor.op-return           the return from the frame
R0072 runtime panic.stale-key             stale arena key: slot {index}, generation {generation}, no longer holds its value
R0073 runtime panic.mutex-held            the lock is already held by this task, which would wait for itself forever
